    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_i_v_stride_use" kindref="compound">IVStrideUse</ref> - Keep track of one use of a strided induction variable. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The Expr member keeps track of the expression, <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_user" kindref="compound">User</ref> is the actual user instruction of the operand, and &apos;OperandValToReplace&apos; is the operand of the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_user" kindref="compound">User</ref> that is the use. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
